{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"notes\": {\n    \"甲\": \"甲清楚地解释了满足感如何生出希望亲近继续的愿望、眼前的充盈为何逐渐不足以承托这个愿望，以及继续用力为何无法解决问题而只会留下未解的牵挂；但它对关系的不确定性如何在此刻浮现、幸福为何突然显得像已经过去，以及身体为何能够从紧绷转向松弛，主要以概括性结论带过。\",\n    \"乙\": \"乙具体解释了满足感退出注意中心后，尚未安顿的自我感受与对对方心意的疑问如何浮现，也说明时间意识如何使当下的幸福显出可能失去的性质，以及身体如何先于明确念头松开抓紧的姿态；其不足是部分心理推演重复且略显繁复，但关键转折都有相应的因果机制，而不只是给感受补上故事。\"\n  },\n  \"verdict\": \"乙 版不差于 甲 版\",\n  \"why\": \"乙不仅说明了失重、疑虑和松弛分别是什么，还交代了注意转移如何暴露未解的不安、对时间流逝的觉察如何改变对幸福的体验，以及身体先行放松如何使人暂时不必继续紧抓，因此在解释此刻感受为何发生及其如何变化方面至少不弱于甲。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "21b70b0f-44d7-49e4-8d35-f3ecaed93bee", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T135307274148Z", "elapsed_seconds": 47.516, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T13:53:54.792113+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c6cf526d216fbc7d6143426f1a1b3a1ca6ee5f4f1feed4e4daaa345a2f3bccdc", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33